<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia Lippo Land to pay 60 rph div.</title>
<headline>Indonesia Lippo Land to pay 60 rph div.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Lippo Land Development said on Monday it will pay a final dividend of 60 rupiah a share for the year ending on June 30, a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>He said shareholders had approved the dividend payment.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
